&lt;p&gt;We are an AI-first company. This means you approach your work with a growth mindset and find ways to leverage AI to help make faster, smarter decisions that will 10X your impact at Box.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with &lt;strong&gt;Scala&lt;/strong&gt;/Java, MySQL, Pub/Sub, BigQuery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or equivalent in Computer Science, Mathematics or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of professional software development experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of common algorithms, data structures and code design principles&lt;/li&gt;
