&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;In accordance with OFCCP compliance, here is the &lt;a href=&quot;https://cloud.box.com/s/sv4dcjqb4tfyfc456rltlucuedth4aln&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Pay Transparency Provision&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;United States Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$110,500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$138,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

