&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is Box?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Box (NYSE:BOX) is the leader in Intelligent Content Management. Our platform enables organizations to fuel collaboration, manage the entire content lifecycle, secure critical content, and transform business workflows with enterprise AI. We help companies thrive in the new AI-first era of business. Founded in 2005, Box simplifies work for leading global organizations, including JLL, Morgan Stanley, and Nationwide. Box is headquartered in Redwood City, CA, with offices across the United States, Europe, and Asia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By joining Box, you will have the unique opportunity to continue driving our platform forward. Content powers how we work. It’s the billions of files and information flowing across teams, departments, and key business processes every single day: contracts, invoices, employee records, financials, product specs, marketing assets, and more. Our mission is to bring intelligence to the world of content management and empower our customers to completely transform workflows across their organizations. With the combination of AI and enterprise content, the opportunity has never been greater to transform how the world works together and at Box you will be on the front lines of this massive shift.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY BOX NEEDS YOU&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Box Marketing Engineering team is seeking a talented Front-End Developer for a full-time position to work with various teams on our marketing, blog, and other customer facing websites. To be successful at this position, you must be a self-starter with the ability to take ownership and handle multiple tasks simultaneously. You must possess good oral and written documentation skills and be able to interact with other team members to deliver fast and reliable code. You must have experience in developing websites using the Drupal platform on a LAMP technology stack along with Nextjs.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own front-end projects from investigation to implementation to testing to release.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with international teammates to foster strong engineering principles and represent our engineering values (Poland - California USA)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product managers, designers, and other cross-functional stakeholders to align on requirements and understand how your work will impact the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO YOU ARE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;We are an AI-first company. This means you approach your work with a growth mindset and find ways to leverage AI to help make faster, smarter decisions that will 10X your impact at Box.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of front-end web development industry experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with front-end technology stack (Javascript - React/Nextjs, HTML, CSS/SASS).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with responsive web design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with Javascript build and automation tools such as NPM, Gulp, or Webpack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with GitHub as a source control repository.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of Drupal site architecture and building blocks including content types, fields entities, taxonomy, and menu system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable using modern web testing frameworks (Playwright/Cypress).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working experience with Adobe Analytics, Adobe Target, Adobe Launch is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Vercel, Acquia, Cloudflare Enterprise and Github Cloud is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Computer Engineering or equivalent professional experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech Stack&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CMS: &lt;/strong&gt;Drupal 11&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hosting: &lt;/strong&gt;Acquia/Vercel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Repository:&lt;/strong&gt; Github Cloud&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A/B Tool: &lt;/strong&gt;Adobe Target&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design tool: &lt;/strong&gt;Figma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
