&lt;li&gt;Research and understand your customers and prospects to gain insight into&amp;nbsp;their business&amp;nbsp;challenges and&amp;nbsp;Box value proposition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and execute strategic account plans for DoW enterprise customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive net-new sales and expand existing business across DoW programs and agencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with system integrators and channel partners to pursue large-scale programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate procurement processes (OTAs, IDIQs, BPA, and sole-source vehicles)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted advisor to DoW leaders, program managers, and acquisition officials and manage through multi-layer stakeholders in Government Agencies&lt;/li&gt;
