&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT IS BOX?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Box (NYSE:BOX) is the leader in Intelligent Content Management. Our platform enables organizations to fuel collaboration, manage the entire content lifecycle, secure critical content, and transform business workflows with enterprise AI. We help companies thrive in the new AI-first era of business. Founded in 2005, Box simplifies work for leading global organizations, including JLL, Morgan Stanley, and Nationwide. Box is headquartered in Redwood City, CA, with offices across the United States, Europe, and Asia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By joining Box, you will have the unique opportunity to continue driving our platform forward. Content powers how we work. It’s the billions of files and information flowing across teams, departments, and key business processes every single day: contracts, invoices, employee records, financials, product specs, marketing assets, and more. Our mission is to bring intelligence to the world of content management and empower our customers to completely transform workflows across their organizations. With the combination of AI and enterprise content, the opportunity has never been greater to transform how the world works together and at Box you will be on the front lines of this massive shift.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Box, we believe unique and diverse experiences benefit our culture, our products, our customers, our company, and our world. We aim to recruit a passionate, high-performing workforce that reflects the world we live in.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;If you are head-over-heels about this role but unsure if you meet all the requirements, we encourage you to apply!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY BOX NEEDS YOU?&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Metadata is a key component of the Box Intelligent Cloud, enabling customers to add additional context to their files and transforming them into actionable content. In the current iteration, it&#39;s used to organize, discover, annotate, secure, and retain content. Metadata Platform adoption continues to grow exponentially as more Box products, like Shield, Relay, Forms, Sign, Governance, etc, rely on it internally and as our customers continue to build custom applications leveraging it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;But, we&#39;ve only scratched the surface of what&#39;s possible. That&#39;s where you come in!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we embark on the mission to deliver a next-generation Metadata Platform, we&#39;re looking for a Senior Software Engineer to join us and play a pivotal role. You&#39;ll have the opportunity to work with a team of talented, collaborative, and fun engineers, solving some of the toughest challenges, as we build out the future of intelligent content management in the cloud. The work you do will have an immediate and lasting impact on the productivity of millions of users, at some of the most important enterprises of our time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead design and implementation efforts for new components of our platform, from the ground up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with partner teams and domain architects on system design and services integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement scalable services with a focus on reliability, observability, operability and efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with cutting-edge technologies like Kubernetes, Docker, BigTable, Elasticsearch, Spark and Istio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be heavily involved in defining the vision and assembling feature roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor other engineers and contribute to team growth and development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strengthen engineering processes, principles, and culture within the team and across Box, by championing a culture of learning, continuous improvement, and blameless retrospection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an AI-first company. This means you approach your work with a growth mindset and find ways to leverage AI to help make faster, smarter decisions that will 10X your impact at Box.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO YOU ARE&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 3+ years of professional software development experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are fluent in expertise in JavaScript/TypeScript and one of modern JavaScript frameworks (React or Vue).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong HTML/CSS knowledge with responsive UIs, state management, accessibility, performance, and security basics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Having some backend coding experience with Node.js is required, and proficiency will be a big advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of scalability and observability practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to design, build, and deploy high-quality software is a must.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience in mentoring and coaching engineers and provide technical feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in spoken and written English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BONUS POINTS FOR&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience deploying and operating microservices in a cloud environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Google Cloud Platform (GCP), Amazon Web Service (AWS) or Azure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;METHODOLOGY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agile management - Scrum&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Issue tracking tool - Jira&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge repository -&amp;nbsp;Confluence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Code reviews -&amp;nbsp;GitHub Enterprise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Version control system - GIT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Box lives its values, with community and in-person collaboration being a core part of our culture. Boxers are expected to work from their assigned office a minimum of &lt;strong&gt;3 days per week, with a focus on Tuesdays, Wednesdays, and Thursdays&lt;/strong&gt;. Your Recruiter will share more about how we work and company culture during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;
