&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY BOX NEEDS YOU&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;AI models are advancing at an extraordinary pace, but AI is only as powerful as the information it can securely access. This is an opportunity to sell a platform at the center of one of the most significant technology shifts of our generation.&amp;nbsp;Enterprises increasingly need a neutral, secure platform that can connect their content and workflows to the best AI models and agents regardless of which model or vendor our customers use. Box provides that foundation.&amp;nbsp;With integrations and capabilities spanning platforms, Box is becoming the connective tissue between enterprise content and the rapidly evolving world of AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re entering the AI-first era of business, where AI agents are joining the workforce: they can search, reason, analyze, and generate content autonomously, all while respecting enterprise permissions and governance. With AI solutions, Box is redefining what it means to turn unstructured content into structured, actionable intelligence. As an Enterprise Account Executive, you&#39;ll be on the front lines of helping customers capitalize on this massive shift, at a moment when the opportunity to transform how the world works with content and AI has never been greater.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;We need strong sellers to help new customers realize their digital transformation goals while evolving how our current customer base leverages Box.&amp;nbsp; By joining the Box Enterprise Sales team you will play a critical role in helping the world&#39;s largest organizations navigate this transformation. You will work with CIOs, CTOs, CISOs, business leaders, developers, and other senior executives to rethink how their organizations manage, protect, and activate enterprise content in the age of AI.&lt;/p&gt;
