&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in applied machine learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong programming skills in Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deployed and maintained ML models serving real traffic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with GCP (Vertex AI, BigQuery, Dataflow) or equivalent (AWS SageMaker, Azure ML)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of feature engineering, model evaluation, and MLOps&lt;/li&gt;
