&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in security/threat detection, anomaly detection, or fraud detection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with sequential data, anomaly detection, or behavioral modeling (time-series forecasting, LSTM, Transformers, or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of LLMs and AI safety (prompt injection, guardrails, red-teaming)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with streaming/real-time ML systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Java for service integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Publications or contributions in ML security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
