&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Authorization:&lt;/strong&gt; Unrestricted right to work in the UK for the full duration of the 12-month placement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Professional working proficiency in German (in addition to English).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; Relationship Building:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong verbal and written communication skills with the confidence to collaborate cross-functionally across regional and international teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creativity &amp;amp; Problem Solving:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactive, curious mindset with the ability to think outside the box, generate fresh ideas, and adapt to fast-paced marketing environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
