&lt;p&gt;Notice to applicants in Los Angeles:&amp;nbsp; Box, Inc and its related branches will consider for employment, qualified applicants with criminal histories in a manner consistent with the Los Angeles Fair Chance Ordinance.&amp;nbsp; The Fair Chance Ordinance is provided &lt;a href=&quot;https://bca.lacity.org/fair-chance&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-attrib-id=&quot;link-821db4b9-b7bc-4982-b0bc-8a9984a11703&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
