&lt;p&gt;パートナーを訪問し、営業担当者との関係をつくり、案件創出、勉強会、セミナー、共同営業などを通じて、Boxを販売いただける機会を増やしていきます。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;社内の営業、Marketing、SE、Customer Successなどとも連携しながら、自分自身でアイデアを出し、行動し、パートナーと一緒にビジネスを大きくしていくことを楽しめる方を求めています。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;複数の販売パートナーを担当し、Partner Business Planや営業施策を策定・実行する&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;パートナーの主管部門だけでなく、営業部門、地域拠点などとの関係を構築する&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;パートナーの営業担当者との接点を増やし、新規案件やPipelineの創出につなげる&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;パートナー向け勉強会、トレーニング、セミナー、共同営業施策などを企画・実行する&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;定例会議やBusiness Reviewを通じて進捗を確認し、次のアクションにつなげる&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salesforceなどを活用してPipelineや案件状況を把握し、必要な営業アクションを実行する&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Direct Sales、Marketing、SE、Customer Successなど社内各部門と連携し、パートナーとのビジネス拡大を推進する&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;担当地域やパートナーへの訪問、宿泊を伴う国内出張があります&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Box ではコミュニティと対面でのコラボレーションを重要視していてます。Box の社員（Boxers）は、少なくとも毎週3日間以上はオフィスで勤務することが求められます。選考プロセスの中で、リクルーターが働き方や企業文化についてさらに詳しくご説明します。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WHO YOU ARE&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;IT業界におけるPartner Sales、Channel Sales、法人営業などの経験&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;販売パートナー、Distributor、SIerなどとのビジネス経験&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;パートナーと良好な関係を構築し、一緒にビジネスを拡大していくことが好きな方&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;パートナーの主管部門だけではなく、営業現場や地域組織など幅広い方々と積極的にコミュニケーションできる方&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;自ら行動し、社内外の関係者を巻き込みながら営業施策を実行できる方&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SalesforceなどのCRMを活用した営業活動の経験&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SaaS、Cloud、Security領域での営業経験（尚可）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Network、Serverなどインフラ・Hardware領域でのChannel Sales経験も歓迎します&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;業務上の英語コミュニケーション力（尚可）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;私たちは「AIファースト」の企業です。&lt;br&gt;すなわち、常に成長マインドセットを持ちながら仕事に取り組み、AIを活用し、より迅速かつ適切な意思決定を行い、インパクトを高める方法を見つけていくことが求められます。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EQUAL OPPORTUNITY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;本ポジションに興味があるけれども、条件を満たしているか不安 という方は、まずはご応募ください。すべての応募資格を満たしていなくても、ご応募いただくことは可能です。Boxでは、Divercity&amp;amp;Inclusionを促進するために、大局的なアプローチで採用活動を行っています。みなさまのご応募をお待ちいたしております。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;私たちはすべての人に等しく機会を提供しており、多様性を尊重しています。人種、宗教、肌の色、国籍、性別、性的指向、年齢、配偶者の有無、退役軍人、身体障害の有無 等による差別は行いません。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ご応募に際する個人情報の保護については、当社の&lt;a href=&quot;https://cloud.app.box.com/v/BoxPersonnelPrivacyNotice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-attrib-id=&quot;link-9a86531e-99d9-438c-9f28-8aa5283ef8ba&quot;&gt;Personnel Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;をご確認ください。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;We are an equal opportunity employer and value diversity at our company. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, or disability status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For details on how we protect your information when you apply, please see our &lt;a href=&quot;https://cloud.app.box.com/v/BoxPersonnelPrivacyNotice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-attrib-id=&quot;link-c3f04c3c-52f0-4e06-8245-05fdf497f726&quot;&gt;Personnel Privacy Notice.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NOTICE OF USE OF AI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;At Box, we believe in the power of AI to improve the recruiting process while keeping people at the heart of every decision. For more information on the use of AI in our hiring process, please visit our webpage &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.box.com/en/how-we-hire/ai-in-our-hiring-process/&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;here&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT IS BOX?&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Box (NYSE:BOX) is the leader in Intelligent Content Management. Our platform enables organizations to fuel collaboration, manage the entire content lifecycle, secure critical content, and transform business workflows with enterprise AI. We help companies thrive in the new AI-first era of business. Founded in 2005, Box simplifies work for leading global organizations, including JLL, Morgan Stanley, and Nationwide. Box is headquartered in Redwood City, CA, with offices across the United States, Europe, and Asia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By joining Box, you will have the unique opportunity to continue driving our platform forward. Content powers how we work. It’s the billions of files and information flowing across teams, departments, and key business processes every single day: contracts, invoices, employee records, financials, product specs, marketing assets, and more. Our mission is to bring intelligence to the world of content management and empower our customers to completely transform workflows across their organizations. With the combination of AI and enterprise content, the opportunity has never been greater to transform how the world works together and at Box you will be on the front lines of this massive shift.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;g-mvk30zbl&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY BOX NEEDS YOU&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Box is looking for a Partner Alliance Manager (PAM) to own and grow our most strategic Systems Integrator (SI) partnerships. In this role, you will be the primary relationship owner for a focused portfolio of SI partners driving joint revenue, co-selling motions, and deep technical alignment between Box and our partner ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will sit at the intersection of sales, product, and strategy, advising partners on Box&#39;s evolving platform. This is a high-impact, high-visibility role for someone who thrives in a consultative, relationship-driven environment and has a proven track record of building and scaling SI partnerships that deliver measurable business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;g-mv8cfaqm&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full partner lifecycle for a portfolio of 2–4 SI partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive co-selling motions including account mapping, opportunity identification, and multi-touch engagement strategies to generate partner-sourced and partner-influenced revenue alongside joint go-to-market strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with SI partners to develop joint solutions that integrate Box&#39;s Intelligent Content Management platform into partner-led customer engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead co-marketing initiatives and partner enablement programs to increase Box&#39;s visibility and technical competency within each partner organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide strategic guidance to partners on Box&#39;s product roadmap and competitive positioning to strengthen partner confidence and advocacy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the internal voice of the partner, aligning cross-functional Box teams — including Sales, Product, and Marketing — around partner priorities and joint opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate pipeline and forecast data, delivering regular reporting on partner performance and growth metrics to leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Box at partner events, industry conferences, and joint customer engagements while staying current on SI market trends, competitive dynamics, and regional customer needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;g-mv8cf8dv&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO YOU ARE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an AI-first company. This means you approach your work with a growth mindset and find ways to leverage AI to help make faster, smarter decisions that will 10X your impact at Box.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;g-mvjzu1bk&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years in &lt;strong&gt;partner management&lt;/strong&gt;, channel sales, or SI-focused business development within SaaS or cloud.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success building and growing strategic partner relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of SI business models, services practices, and co-sell motions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to influence executives and drive alignment across complex organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with resellers, distributors, SIs, cloud marketplaces, and ISVs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business planning, forecasting, and pipeline management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salesforce proficiency and comfort with partner-attached pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-directed, strategic, and able to manage multiple partners simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in the US with ~25% travel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;g-mvjzu1bl&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of the ECM ecosystem and an established network within SI partner organizations that service platforms such as OpenText, IBM, OnBase, or iManage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior PAM or SI partner management experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with SaaS indirect sales motions and cloud marketplaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing partner practices across multiple regions or segments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of content management, security, collaboration, or digital transformation solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to leverage AI tools to drive smarter decisions and greater impact across partner operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SUCCESS METRICS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth in partner-sourced and partner-influenced ARR.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strength and execution of joint business plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner capability maturity and practice development progress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-sell pipeline creation and progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forecast accuracy and partner governance discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Field and partner satisfaction with partnership impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Box lives its values, with community and in-person collaboration being a core part of our culture. Boxers are expected to work from their assigned office a minimum of 3 days per week. Your Recruiter will share more about how we work and company culture during the hiring process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Box, we believe unique and diverse experiences benefit our culture, our products, our customers, our company, and our world. We aim to recruit a passionate, high-performing workforce that reflects the world we live in. If you are head-over-heels about this role but unsure if you meet all the requirements, we encourage you to apply!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;g-mvk33014&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EQUAL OPPORTUNITY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and value diversity at our company. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, disability, and any other protected ground of discrimination under applicable human rights legislation. Box strives to respect the dignity and ‎‎independence of people with disabilities and is committed to giving them the same ‎‎opportunity to succeed as all other employees. Inclusiveness is core to our culture at Box, and we strive to ensure you get the most from your interview experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Box makes reasonable accommodations for applicants with disabilities. If a reasonable accommodation is needed to participate in the job application or interview process, please complete &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/5W2F6Pe3PsZNsKYp9&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-attrib-id=&quot;link-d1606988-d325-45f0-a4ca-de74c0917ecd&quot;&gt;this form&lt;/a&gt;. Reasonable accommodations may include scheduling adjustments, document dictation and beyond.&lt;/p&gt;
