&lt;p&gt;For details on how we protect your information when you apply, please see our &lt;a href=&quot;https://cloud.app.box.com/v/BoxPersonnelPrivacyNotice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-attrib-id=&quot;link-c1d27f0b-8ac5-4cc8-bbff-3894c8b25e2e&quot;&gt;Personnel Privacy Notice.&lt;/a&gt; If you are a California-resident, please read our California Applicant &amp;amp; Candidate Privacy Notice &lt;a href=&quot;https://cloud.box.com/s/uf7c4w970ds5gpt1dufdk5bw49oym849&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-attrib-id=&quot;link-a18f4abd-1197-4e3e-8caa-81eaffb141e5&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NOTICE OF USE OF AI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;At Box, we believe in the power of AI to improve the recruiting process while keeping people at the heart of every decision. For more information on the use of AI in our hiring process, please visit our webpage &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.box.com/en/how-we-hire/ai-in-our-hiring-process/&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;here&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;c-message_kit__blocks c-message_kit__blocks--rich_text&quot;&gt;
