&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Conduct strategic adoption business reviews that focus on outcomes, ROI and future opportunities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proactively identify risks and opportunities within accounts, using both qualitative insight and data to guide action&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner cross-functionally with Sales, Product, Engineering and Professional Services to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Expand Box’s footprint within the customer&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Influence product direction based on real-world use cases&lt;/p&gt;
