&lt;p&gt;Serve as the voice of the customer, bringing structured insights on workflows, pain points and AI opportunities back to internal team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO YOU ARE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an AI-first company. You approach your work with a growth mindset and actively look for ways to leverage AI to drive smarter decisions, unlock new use cases, and increase your impact&lt;/p&gt;
