&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excel at everything you put your heart and mind to&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Willingness to go above and beyond&lt;/p&gt;
