&lt;p&gt;For details on how we protect your information when you apply, please see our &lt;a href=&quot;https://cloud.app.box.com/v/BoxPersonnelPrivacyNotice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-attrib-id=&quot;link-c1d27f0b-8ac5-4cc8-bbff-3894c8b25e2e&quot;&gt;Personnel Privacy Notice.&lt;/a&gt; If you are a California-resident, please read our California Applicant &amp;amp; Candidate Privacy Notice &lt;a href=&quot;https://cloud.box.com/s/uf7c4w970ds5gpt1dufdk5bw49oym849&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-attrib-id=&quot;link-a18f4abd-1197-4e3e-8caa-81eaffb141e5&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
