&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 [&amp;quot;bullet_list&amp;quot;,null,&amp;quot;bullet_list&amp;quot;,null,&amp;quot;list_item&amp;quot;,null]&quot;&gt;At Box, we believe in the power of AI to improve the recruiting process while keeping people at the heart of every decision. For more information on the use of AI in our hiring process, please visit our webpage &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.box.com/en/how-we-hire/ai-in-our-hiring-process/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-attrib-id=&quot;link-b6d5ae6d-3111-427e-8883-655af5f92bce&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;c-message_kit__blocks c-message_kit__blocks--rich_text&quot;&gt;
