&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and value diversity at our company. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, disability, and any other protected ground of discrimination under applicable human rights legislation.&lt;br&gt;For details on how we protect your information when you apply, please see our &lt;a href=&quot;https://cloud.app.box.com/v/BoxPersonnelPrivacyNotice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-attrib-id=&quot;link-2f2015c1-154d-4eca-934b-6817d26cf18c&quot;&gt;Personnel Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;For more details on how Box Poland protects your information, please see our &lt;a href=&quot;https://cloud.box.com/s/tyclibn73pmofpdub2x65639ykknbiwj&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-attrib-id=&quot;link-4b65ca49-51b7-483f-9f2f-9d7f02e450bc&quot;&gt;Supplemental Personnel and Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
