&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Box needs you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Software Engineer on the Desktop Applications team at Box, you&#39;ll be at the heart of building and evolving the products that millions of users rely on every day - Box Drive, Box Tools, and Box for Office on both Windows and macOS. You&#39;ll work across the full depth of the desktop stack, from virtual file systems and OS integrations to sync, networking, and UI, helping shape how enterprise content comes to life on the desktop. You&#39;ll collaborate closely with Product Managers and designers to deliver features that are fast, reliable, and secure - and you&#39;ll bring a growth mindset and a passion for leveraging AI tools to accelerate your impact.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
