&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-annotation-id=&quot;01051c34-2a6e-4e34-b44d-13fd3c9db3d3&quot; data-author-id=&quot;28954989377&quot;&gt;Actively engage in team meetings, building roadmaps, carving technical vision and spreading knowledge across engineering departament&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
