&lt;li&gt;Participate in our on-call rotation, available at all times while on-call to help respond to and triage any issues that arise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn and grow alongside us! Many team members engage in mentoring relationships so we can continuously improve ourselves as well as support each other’s growth. We also enjoy exploring architectural advancements in UX across mobile platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
