&lt;ul data-pm-slice=&quot;3 3 []&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with working Agent Orchestrated software development and/or experience building AI into products&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience using AI and tool chain (e.g. cursor, claude, codex) to automate manual processes to improve your and your team’s productivity&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;7+ years in technical program management, driving large cross-functional programs and initiatives in fast-paced tech companies&lt;/p&gt;
