&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;地域カンファレンス、BoxWorks、顧客イベント、パートナーセミナー等でContent + AI／ICMの市場啓発をリードし、Boxの思考リーダーシップを高める&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;営業、CSM、コンサルティング、プロフェッショナルサービス、パートナーと連携し、導入後の定着・利活用・拡張まで含む顧客成功を実現する&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Box ではコミュニティと対面でのコラボレーションを重要視していてます。Box の社員（Boxers）は、少なくとも毎週3日間以上はオフィスで勤務することが求められます。選考プロセスの中で、リクルーターが働き方や企業文化についてさらに詳しくご説明します。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO YOU ARE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;私たちは「AIファースト」の企業です。&lt;br&gt;すなわち、常に成長マインドセットを持ちながら仕事に取り組み、AIを活用し、より迅速かつ適切な意思決定を行い、インパクトを高める方法を見つけていくことが求められます。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;5年以上のプリセールス、ソリューションアーキテクト、ITコンサルティング、または企業向けテクノロジー提案の経験&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;2年以上のSolutions Engineering／プリセールスチームのピープルマネジメント経験（採用、目標設定、評価、育成を含む）&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;クラウド、SaaS、セキュリティ、エンタープライズアーキテクチャ、SaaS連携、AI／自動化の複数領域に関する実務知識&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;大手企業への複雑なハイタッチ型提案、経営層・技術意思決定者との合意形成、パートナー／アライアンス協業の成功実績&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;技術的な深さとビジネス視点を行き来し、複雑な内容を明快に伝え、チームと顧客双方から信頼を得られるリーダーシップ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Hungry, Humble, Smartの姿勢で、変化の速いAI市場を学び続け、強いオーナーシップで成果を生み出す意欲&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;ネイティブレベルまたはビジネスレベル以上の日本語、およびグローバルチームと協働できる英語力（読み書き）&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EQUAL OPPORTUNITY&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and value diversity at our company. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, disability, and any other protected ground of discrimination under applicable human rights legislation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For details on how we protect your information when you apply, please see our &lt;a href=&quot;https://cloud.app.box.com/v/BoxPersonnelPrivacyNotice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-attrib-id=&quot;link-8199410c-084c-4220-9a8f-6a5aad40ef33&quot;&gt;Personnel Privacy Notice.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NOTICE OF USE OF AI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 [&amp;quot;bullet_list&amp;quot;,null,&amp;quot;bullet_list&amp;quot;,null,&amp;quot;list_item&amp;quot;,null]&quot;&gt;At Box, we believe in the power of AI to improve the recruiting process while keeping people at the heart of every decision. For more information on the use of AI in our hiring process, please visit our webpage &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.box.com/en/how-we-hire/ai-in-our-hiring-process/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-attrib-id=&quot;link-b6d5ae6d-3111-427e-8883-655af5f92bce&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT IS BOX?&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Box (NYSE:BOX) is the leader in Intelligent Content Management. Our platform enables organizations to fuel collaboration, manage the entire content lifecycle, secure critical content, and transform business workflows with enterprise AI. We help companies thrive in the new AI-first era of business. Founded in 2005, Box simplifies work for leading global organizations, including JLL, Morgan Stanley, and Nationwide. Box is headquartered in Redwood City, CA, with offices across the United States, Europe, and Asia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By joining Box, you will have the unique opportunity to continue driving our platform forward. Content powers how we work. It’s the billions of files and information flowing across teams, departments, and key business processes every single day: contracts, invoices, employee records, financials, product specs, marketing assets, and more. Our mission is to bring intelligence to the world of content management and empower our customers to completely transform workflows across their organizations. With the combination of AI and enterprise content, the opportunity has never been greater to transform how the world works together and at Box you will be on the front lines of this massive shift.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY BOX NEEDS YOU&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Box Consulting is a fast growing team helping customers rapidly deploy, maximize value, and deeply integrate Box into their enterprises. Your proven ability to work creatively and analytically on complex, multi phase engagements with the most strategic of customers will help you build, manage, and scale your team in highly engaged environment.&amp;nbsp; Excellent communication, leadership, and management skills enable you to grow the team&#39;s professional development while staying highly engaged with customers - an opportunity for your team to learn the depth of your delivery expertise on the job.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Box is growing fast. Real fast. Every business in the world is looking to modernize the way they work. As the leader in cloud content management, Box is the only company that can help enterprises transform how people work together.&amp;nbsp; Your years of experience with project management and business process design, combined with expert knowledge of internal processes and related systems, empower you to be an influential leader within Box Consulting and more broadly across all of Box.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Manager, you will be scaling a world-class team, working closely with our customers as a thought leader, shape &amp;amp; evolve consulting delivery offerings, and drive new business with your sales partners.&amp;nbsp; You will bring the energy and expertise to inspire our customers and influence Box Consulting&#39;s strategic direction.&amp;nbsp; You will lead teams of varying levels of experience, thrive in dynamic &amp;amp; cross-functional environments, and enjoy achieving results thru engaging directly with our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO YOU ARE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have solid people management experience, including hiring, onboarding as well as cultivating professional development opportunities as part of performance management functions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;6+ years service delivery experience in technology&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A firm understanding of how services and project delivery impacts financial performance with regard to individual utilization and revenue realization&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Works autonomously with limited guidance - Strong sense of urgency for customer issues. Comfortable leading larger teams including cross-functional members&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work closely with sales teams and industry managing directors to effectively develop clear and successful GTM strategy&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Accurately forecast and effectively manage resources against revenue, pipeline, and bookings targets&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Apply leadership acumen and operational excellence to tracking, forecasting, and closing pipeline&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pipeline generation and qualification, employing varied techniques, demonstrating creative, resourceful and committed approach&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Regularly interacts with and influences senior management, other functional areas such as Customer Success, Support, Sales and/or external parties&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Focuses on maximizing customer delight and outcomes in all conversations across Box; consistent advocacy of customer experience cross functionally with all levels of leadership&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Assess business needs, document requirements, provide estimated effort and create contracts (SOWs, Change Orders, etc.)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2+ years of management experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2+ years of consulting sales experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experienced working with SI and Reseller partners to co-sell services&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Direct familiarity with a quota-carrying role, either in a management or individual contributor capacity&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Background in SaaS, ECM technologies, AI or Software engineering&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Box lives its values, with community and in-person collaboration being a core part of our culture. Boxers are expected to work from their assigned office a minimum of 3 days per week.Your Recruiter will share more about how we work and company culture during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Box, we believe unique and diverse experiences benefit our culture, our products, our customers, our company, and our world. We aim to recruit a passionate, high-performing workforce that reflects the world we live in.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;If you are head-over-heels about this role but unsure if you meet all the requirements, we encourage you to apply!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EQUAL OPPORTUNITY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and value diversity at our company. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, disability, and any other protected ground of discrimination under applicable human rights legislation. Box strives to respect the dignity and ‎‎independence of people with disabilities and is committed to giving them the same ‎‎opportunity to succeed as all other employees. Inclusiveness is core to our culture at Box, and we strive to ensure you get the most from your interview experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Box makes reasonable accommodations for applicants with disabilities. If a reasonable accommodation is needed to participate in the job application or interview process, please complete &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/5W2F6Pe3PsZNsKYp9&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-attrib-id=&quot;link-9ae9d0dd-03cc-4d6e-9884-fd6db8df7157&quot;&gt;this form&lt;/a&gt;. Reasonable accommodations may include scheduling adjustments, document dictation and beyond.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notice to applicants in Los Angeles:&amp;nbsp; Box, Inc and its related branches will consider for employment, qualified applicants with criminal histories in a manner consistent with the Los Angeles Fair Chair Ordinance.&amp;nbsp; The Fair Chance Ordinance is provided &lt;a href=&quot;https://bca.lacity.org/fair-chance&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-attrib-id=&quot;link-821db4b9-b7bc-4982-b0bc-8a9984a11703&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notice to applicants in San Francisco:&amp;nbsp; Box, Inc and its related branches will consider for employment, qualified applicants with criminal histories in a manner consistent with the San Francisco Fair Chair Ordinance.&amp;nbsp; The Fair Chance Ordinance is provided &lt;a href=&quot;https://sfgov.org/olse/sites/default/files/FCO%20poster2020.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-attrib-id=&quot;link-2c0c325e-d3bd-470c-af25-4a2904f5ebb6&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For details on how we protect your information when you apply, please see our &lt;a href=&quot;https://cloud.app.box.com/v/BoxPersonnelPrivacyNotice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-attrib-id=&quot;link-c1d27f0b-8ac5-4cc8-bbff-3894c8b25e2e&quot;&gt;Personnel Privacy Notice.&lt;/a&gt; If you are a California-resident, please read our California Applicant &amp;amp; Candidate Privacy Notice &lt;a href=&quot;https://cloud.box.com/s/uf7c4w970ds5gpt1dufdk5bw49oym849&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-attrib-id=&quot;link-a18f4abd-1197-4e3e-8caa-81eaffb141e5&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Box, we believe in the power of AI to improve the recruiting process while keeping people at the heart of every decision. For more information on the use of AI in our hiring process, please visit our webpage &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.box.com/en/how-we-hire/ai-in-our-hiring-process/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://careers.box.com/en/how-we-hire/ai-in-our-hiring-process/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1792868541289000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2gRlr0mNDJof7sL6qTCN1R&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Box is committed to fair and equitable compensation practices. Actual base salary (or OTE if commissionable role) is dependent upon factors such as: knowledge, skill level, experience, and work location. This role is also eligible for equity and benefits. For more information, check out our &lt;a href=&quot;https://cloud.app.box.com/file/680236394456?s=3u38zhdv4gac9h0j7lmumm7arbe14yqa&quot;&gt;benefits and perks&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In accordance with OFCCP compliance, here is the &lt;a href=&quot;https://cloud.box.com/s/sv4dcjqb4tfyfc456rltlucuedth4aln&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Pay Transparency Provision&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Chicago Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$132,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$160,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h3 id=&quot;g-mvsf24fr&quot;&gt;WHAT IS BOX?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Box is the market leader for Cloud Content Management and Intelligent Content Management. Our mission is to power how the world works together. Box partners with enterprise organizations across the globe to accelerate their digital transformation by providing a unified platform for secure content management, collaboration, automated workflow, and generative AI integrations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By joining Box, you will have the unique opportunity to help shape the future of intelligent content management for the modern enterprise. Today, Box powers over 115,000+ businesses, including a significant majority of the Fortune 500, who trust our secure platform to protect, govern, and extract value from the entire content lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;g-mvsf24fs&quot;&gt;WHY BOX NEEDS YOU&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a high-energy, proactive, and hands-on leader to join our Technical Accounting and External Reporting team. The ideal candidate thrives in external reporting, technical accounting research, and policy formulation, and possesses excellent verbal and written communication skills. You are a strategic problem solver capable of translating complex accounting guidance into actionable, scalable business solutions in a fast-paced, high-growth environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;g-mvsf24ft&quot;&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Research &amp;amp; Accounting Policy:&lt;/strong&gt; Evaluate the accounting treatment for complex and non-routine transactions (e.g., debt and equity offerings, strategic investments, M&amp;amp;A, cloud infrastructure commitments, and new product initiatives). Research US GAAP and SEC regulations, draft clear and authoritative technical accounting memorandums, and maintain/update global corporate accounting policies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;External Reporting &amp;amp; SEC Filings:&lt;/strong&gt; Prepare, review, and coordinate financial statements and footnote disclosures for external SEC filings, including Form 10-K, Form 10-Q, Form 8-K, Proxy Statements, and other regulatory filings using modern disclosure management tools (e.g., Workiva/Wdesk).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contract &amp;amp; Commercial Reviews:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner cross-functionally with Legal, Sales Operations, and Procurement to review non-standard revenue, vendor, and licensing contracts to identify accounting implications and ensure policy compliance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Audit Management &amp;amp; Coordination:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead technical accounting discussions and coordination for quarterly reviews and annual audits, managing deliverables and relationships with internal and external auditors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Month-End &amp;amp; Financial Operations:&lt;/strong&gt; Prepare and review monthly/quarterly reconciliation schedules, journal entries, and variance analyses for technical accounting areas (e.g., stock-based compensation, leases, capitalized software, debt/equity, and segment reporting).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a trusted technical advisor across Controllership, FP&amp;amp;A, Treasury, Tax, Legal, Workplace Services, and Engineering teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Improvement &amp;amp; AI Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Champion continuous process improvement, leveraging automation tools and AI-driven workflows to streamline reporting cycles and enhance operational efficiency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SOX Compliance &amp;amp; Internal Controls:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, implement, and maintain effective internal controls over financial reporting (SOX 404) for technical accounting and external reporting processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;g-mvsf24fu&quot;&gt;WHO YOU ARE&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an AI-first company. This means you approach your work with a growth mindset and find ways to leverage AI to help make faster, smarter decisions that will 10X your impact at Box.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;5–7+ years of progressive accounting experience, including Big 4 public accounting experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Accounting, Finance, or a related field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Active CPA license (or equivalent).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong technical knowledge of US GAAP and SEC reporting regulations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven track record of drafting comprehensive technical accounting memos and disclosures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exceptional analytical, problem-solving, project management, and organizational abilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Outstanding written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to articulate complex accounting concepts to both financial and non-financial audiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Skills &amp;amp; Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with high-growth SaaS or technology companies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proficiency with NetSuite, Workiva (Wdesk), and modern financial systems/ERP platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deep familiarity with key standards, including ASC 606 (Revenue Recognition), ASC 842 (Leases), ASC 718 (Stock Compensation), ASC 350-40 (Internal-Use Software), and ASC 230 (Statement of Cash Flows).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with workflow automation and data analytics tools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
